    {
      "source": "Helper method used to create a <a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a> instance with the configured\n<a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converters</code></a> provided by the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>callback</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于通过由<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.util.function\"><code>callback</code></a>提供的配置的<a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converters</code></a>创建<a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a>实例的辅助方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converter</code></a> registered for the given <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>property</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取为给定<a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>property</code></a>注册的<a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>converter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Check if a <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converter</code></a> is registered for\nthe given <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>property</code></a>.",
      "translation": "检查是否已为给定的<a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>property</code></a>注册了<a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>converter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a> provides access to <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converters</code></a> that may only be\napplied to a specific <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>property</code></a>. Other than\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>converters</code></a> registered in <a href=\"CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a>,\nthe <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>property</code></a> based variants accept and allow returning null values\nand provide access to a store-specific <a href=\"ValueConversionContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>conversion context</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a> 提供了对 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>converters</code></a> 的访问权限，这些转换器仅可应用于特定的 <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>property</code></a>。除了注册在 <a href=\"CustomConversions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的类\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a> 中的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.convert.converter 中的类或接口\"><code>converters</code></a> 之外，基于 <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>property</code></a> 的变体接受并允许返回 null 值，并提供对特定存储的 <a href=\"ValueConversionContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>conversion context</code></a> 的访问权限。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if no <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> was registered for\nthe given <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果未为给定的 <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 注册任何 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>property</code> - <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> used to look up the registered <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>;\nmust not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>property</code> - 用于查找已注册的 <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 的 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>；\n不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if a specific <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converter</code></a> is registered for\nthe given <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果已为给定的<a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>注册了特定的<a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>converter</code></a>，则为 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> registered for the given <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>;\nnever null.",
      "translation": "为给定<a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"接口在org.springframework.data.mapping包中\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>注册的<a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"接口在org.springframework.data.convert包中\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>；\n永远不会为null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>property</code> - <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> to evaluate; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>property</code> - 要评估的<a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
